#: scenario3:scenario3_D94E54B6_BEB8_42C3_911C_659E587625D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84f9f4cc597328d30fb965981c9e9d1cf1a389192b7f60d2ec0fe1bf407928c3
#. default-sha256: 48ed41a3140bd3cc9e1f75259764b1c566f856665d1a56c77006d34204dbf94c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D94E54B6_BEB8_42C3_911C_659E587625D6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫...Jacopo?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫……야코포……?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2DF7179A_50DD_48A1_B9C4_D0C6B18EBD99
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8baa9b78a13f3b62fda6dbb0604c400cadda8516dc989a09fc4aaaae7fcf6efe
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2DF7179A_50DD_48A1_B9C4_D0C6B18EBD99"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_07C975E2_D356_4E7B_844A_489E8DC63ADD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79a8eec0700a37bcdf0c4eba27531e59830416cbe8241514c60f8941df46364e
#. default-sha256: 70c5c791728fab503d960a5e21e0f63d4b58c6979d69f22530d852ccdc734e55
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_07C975E2_D356_4E7B_844A_489E8DC63ADD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Where’s your dad?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or are you here alone?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네 아빠는? ⟪k:1⟫혼자 여기 왔어?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FB79E208_7D31_47CF_A0DA_ABBDAFA22C4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2220e0ed6caddfdf457a5918f1947963d2004d1d2e020abdd18a8b232c3a8aa9
#. default-sha256: 736db1e700b78fe56d78ba0e4e09aa8924583a07747f229b6f87b7429629c724
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FB79E208_7D31_47CF_A0DA_ABBDAFA22C4F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He... ⟪k:1⟫didn’t even tell me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아버지는 ⟪k:1⟫나한테 안 알려 줬어……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6FE290DD_7AD9_4B2C_A50A_31C5965984F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9391be75f6698102b28a4e62d82f694317fe51a8dd172fc98b392769aa4fc233
#. default-sha256: 5f0a00794b2e463f341c9266581603fbaddfa08696e0646e0d0ecf9e32b24416
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6FE290DD_7AD9_4B2C_A50A_31C5965984F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CDA793AA_8C43_4FEC_9F5D_017005C93182
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60f07c9cdd765f28bd49fac843f5f3ef6e658cd2042e6af26d94afa537fa4756
#. default-sha256: 7267b44a182d7cfdec37db1ec9bf22596732ebae694adf7aadfaa71be5fae772
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CDA793AA_8C43_4FEC_9F5D_017005C93182"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There’s... ⟪k:1⟫no reason you have to leave town.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫My old man says the Campanellas "
"have more power."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫굳이…… ⟪k:1⟫네가 도시에서 나갈 필요는 없잖아.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫아버지도 이 도시에선 ⟪k:4⟫캄파넬라가 "
"더 강하다고 했어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_16A96EA9_EC19_443A_9899_DD960278A6BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6bd98840ad15bb5cd7937804ceb706a63e6c01b7ca0bd8ec3abe26078886774
#. default-sha256: d6e20195f6364bba958cab2f8e97b55b7f104b0f9acb8383cd1339ce282ad0c6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_16A96EA9_EC19_443A_9899_DD960278A6BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I should be the one leaving."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그럼 ⟪k:1⟫내가 나가는 게 맞을 거 아니야."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A434A8E_FC21_45BB_B783_9126F1B071DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 200ee80d53022423a4a10066d84b94023e0908474c58451aeee3baaf0b7ca6d3
#. default-sha256: e53ba2469b442e6057661f41e38b3de2a67552121b7e97a51c2a390015db1681
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A434A8E_FC21_45BB_B783_9126F1B071DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’s not that simple.⟪k:1⟫Grownups have a lot to consider.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So don’t give me that "
"look, Jacopo."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어른들 세계는 많이 복잡해.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫야코포가 그런 표정 지을 거 없어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ED963991_E6FC_4B9D_8FD8_2632C7573FA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8baa9b78a13f3b62fda6dbb0604c400cadda8516dc989a09fc4aaaae7fcf6efe
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ED963991_E6FC_4B9D_8FD8_2632C7573FA6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_94BEA963_2835_4F52_912F_6D6743EBAE65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fab860bd6b6f4856a99d8f1618b4df1a5781302e63541016a2c0ae28a73c320
#. default-sha256: 1339002b09440136f340fd7523762e6d416ef0e0312321273655a043924f967f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_94BEA963_2835_4F52_912F_6D6743EBAE65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We were kids, but we’d both kinda started to catch on—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to the situation with our "
"families, and to the bonds that land held on us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫피차 ⟪k:1⟫어린 나이에 어렴풋이 알고 있었지.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫우리 둘의 집안이나 ⟪k:4⟫이 토지의 멍에 "
"등."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B0E1009B_E596_43B6_8C25_F53242CA2929
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca9e7619580bd890e7c22fbaaadf991531b77207d68e01c0110f5318dd44c8a2
#. default-sha256: d09e60280a58c4b78c20554f17417918e5b659d969ee3c237f9c47cf14a17ced
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B0E1009B_E596_43B6_8C25_F53242CA2929"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although we didn’t know any of the details at the time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 당시엔 자세한 거는 몰랐지만 ⟪k:1⟫말이야."

#: scenario3:scenario3_420E9C01_B49E_4D3D_9484_B9EB1E8426BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d012d14bdce9dd0dd784edc017cb6df4be6186c3a476ed8b7020e7190c3671a
#. default-sha256: 10087394f382f74a768c1ad07c58bee03d89c040c53aee8510af6e94b4e41b51
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_420E9C01_B49E_4D3D_9484_B9EB1E8426BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My grandpa owned all the land the city was built on, but he was a very conservative man. "
"⟪k:1⟫He didn’t try to spread his influence, instead opting to fortify what he already had."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫도시의 대지주는 내 할아버지였지. ⟪k:1⟫하지만 ⟪k:2⟫보수적인 사람이었어.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫권력을 확장하"
"지 않고 ⟪k:5⟫안쪽으로만 굳히려는 타입……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_44E5E60F_619F_4783_9AF8_6D59FB70B4CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ac364d15b25a6a3f7b12396695cc0fe039bf5c2b8485c19acace7ef2497689e
#. default-sha256: 48941b050b5ef97e947c6a9c83d4ef7ceffc77554df42e31324fecca620c24e3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_44E5E60F_619F_4783_9AF8_6D59FB70B4CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t know exactly when it first started, but organizations were used to administrate "
"cities."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어느 시대부턴진 몰라도 ⟪k:1⟫도시를 관리하는 조직이 만들어졌어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FE03D2C2_CE9D_49A0_AD09_93D508BD862D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dbe497a22e1b1d92826dfa4502a9817bbf37869d22da611a8fc24f4cec11fbcc
#. default-sha256: b452dde2da8b71e83f4299ccc3f30e55ad930bfd48bbea1900df2d06b237eb66
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FE03D2C2_CE9D_49A0_AD09_93D508BD862D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And when we were kids, my dad was the capofamiglia, and my grandpa his consigliere."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫우리가 어릴 때는 ⟪k:1⟫내 아버지가 카포＜두목＞였고, ⟪k:2⟫할아버지가 콘실리에리＜상담역＞였지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DE4155A7_D75E_47AA_BA2F_C5237A5D2575
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6ed3817678f3ae67f11b01bfc20c1153fc625dde0a010791d512edf8f57356f
#. default-sha256: a300334d37200f06bbb74997d82bf8cca2006d01ef9b7510cf47934823982396
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DE4155A7_D75E_47AA_BA2F_C5237A5D2575"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But just because he was an adviser didn’t mean he was powerless. ⟪k:1⟫While my dad made the "
"decisions, my grandpa was the only one allowed to fight him on them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그런데 ⟪k:1⟫이 상담역이란 게 ⟪k:2⟫만만히 볼 게 못 된단 말이지.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫결정권은 아버지가 가"
"졌지만, ⟪k:5⟫말은 할아버지가 꺼냈거든."

#: scenario3:scenario3_56045517_5319_4499_BB6B_D42414E734FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b764b78a6b8e1032d802830f77b5a07f30d898e799e1b3115ceb439967dd403b
#. default-sha256: 58844590c71dcdf0421c83e5ceef6f48b58fc75e8a2ad104586df0ac66e9e497
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56045517_5319_4499_BB6B_D42414E734FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Your father was a capodecina that served under my dad; ⟪k:1⟫he wasn’t especially happy about "
"that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네 아버지는 ⟪k:1⟫내 아버지 밑에서 카포레지메＜간부＞로 있었는데, 그런 체제를 싫어했지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E92A8C87_218D_41CE_9786_583BDA361FB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1d594caa0e0fc074edf2152cc022cbc5299dcb8e55127a503b4a7540010a96b
#. default-sha256: 8d6ec8ddbc8f7cd0849be9a40e4c1ba72d645a7af26619a5032f7a9538dda08e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E92A8C87_218D_41CE_9786_583BDA361FB7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But parents’ quarreling doesn’t affect their kids—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or at least, that’s what I "
"thought at the time, and what you probably thought too."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫부모 간의 싸움은 ⟪k:2⟫애들하곤 상관이 없잖아?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫적어도 내 생각은 그랬고, "
"⟪k:5⟫네 생각도 그랬지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_28B62F9C_A22F_4061_8C74_AF06E01EF4AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fcf6358d7628d6001866e38ad2738adb80fa5e693ce419d93f8fbebf7c4eede3
#. default-sha256: 6d9620e89a5659538da6575d1550c92aa32d5e7ac088fb37d382b1f3f96de005
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_28B62F9C_A22F_4061_8C74_AF06E01EF4AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But there was still a chance we could be caught in the crossfire, so my dad decided to send "
"me and my mom away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래도 ⟪k:1⟫애들한테 불똥이 튈 수도 있는 건⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫사실이라서…… ⟪k:4⟫아버지는 ⟪k:5⟫나랑 어"
"머니를 멀리 피신시키려 했어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F203B666_9A02_4FA1_97BC_4021E9442EBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10b58e9ab1c0ae4e6ec41ea966f5e164c02ba857b1ac263fedbf564c81eadbaa
#. default-sha256: df0fb8430b2868f5e456540a4fafd8c9d2eef92320a7ce52301b83d2f64686cd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F203B666_9A02_4FA1_97BC_4021E9442EBC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Off the island and to the north were some more prosperous areas."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫섬 밖으로 나와 ⟪k:1⟫북쪽에 있는―― 번성한 곳으로."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EFB90E92_858C_4A69_8A70_A1F053E3BA3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bffa91ea9d77063cd0e4f8c963177fb1b6e481a94dd9614779f890f2e38e8f08
#. default-sha256: 5b594d3be1841ae7b8e65634a155b75e2dfe5ff7d67e8954fa4d2689ff9c0f26
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EFB90E92_858C_4A69_8A70_A1F053E3BA3A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He thought that by sending us there, we could live our lives clean, regardless of where we "
"came from."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫북쪽으로 가면 ⟪k:1⟫우리 같은 태생도―― ⟪k:2⟫평화롭게 살 만할 거라 본 거지. ⟪k:3⟫그럴 줄 안 거"
"야."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FB5A0103_4072_4CE8_97DE_29C346E2241A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9a21b804d73ad34606be89e6eae90cbe5b34e389671e1e3b1e3c47b9fa047e7
#. default-sha256: de98d36bdd3fceb3c609cbac97fa710e101e0a4ae2fe24da7a8e72e2430c72d7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FB5A0103_4072_4CE8_97DE_29C346E2241A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There’s no changing what’s in your blood, though."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어딜 가든 ⟪k:1⟫혈통은 바뀌지도 않는데."

#: scenario3:scenario3_65B10959_E51A_4BFE_BAD9_71004141E3EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07eb120651d061666cb30c6710bd4945a52c247ae2dfc8d9e09e9754a7f660ef
#. default-sha256: 003a9fd9dd21163d42455f6ae5375d74a41309cbf23e05374e1279b9b21512e1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_65B10959_E51A_4BFE_BAD9_71004141E3EF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You could have told me too.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or were you planning on leaving without saying anything?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……너도 ⟪k:1⟫말을 해 주지 그랬어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫아무 말도 안 하고 ⟪k:4⟫나가려 했어?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_238D2C70_8B02_445E_A29F_79A27DE018DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7647755d2a3e416a05a21928ec796f59d06a52fd9e9317be726be5b48f2e6331
#. default-sha256: 96d1ec8efac817de2c554be1a9f4f1b642d6bb8929e83bbcc90f804c54bf5d8b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_238D2C70_8B02_445E_A29F_79A27DE018DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No, it was just... ⟪k:1⟫all decided so quickly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그건 아닌데……, ⟪k:1⟫정해진 것도 ⟪k:2⟫갑작스러웠거든."

#: scenario3:scenario3_526F465D_F414_4B7B_BDFB_CBB6009BBC02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de0201cc660cda3af64e6832d34855118a0f9f799c59b6a35dde16777dd686bb
#. default-sha256: 514004d3fb593b5bf91aada591494df7988b20aa9faa76d652c65dfb531543c4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_526F465D_F414_4B7B_BDFB_CBB6009BBC02"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why do you sound so accepting?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왜 그렇게…… ⟪k:1⟫담담하게 말해."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E46D378D_F8E2_4F01_9878_B209DD6FB66B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49cedab1bc4463057764b31d61fe10fdca32a2b1722c8791a6ab6aabe2bd42e1
#. default-sha256: 53a933a78a384e68e685a01a7ebfa4624ba012578871e2c9384b3b433388bd8e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E46D378D_F8E2_4F01_9878_B209DD6FB66B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Adults have a lot to consider?⟪k:1⟫You bet they do! But you could at least let them know "
"you’re opposed to it, Maria! But no, your tail went straight between your legs as soon as you "
"were told."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어른들 세계가 복잡하다고? ⟪k:1⟫그렇기야 하겠지! ⟪k:2⟫하지만 마리아, ⟪k:3⟫넌 반항 하나 안 하"
"고 ⟪k:4⟫처음부터 고분고분 따르기만 하게!?"

