"게, ⟪k:4⟫애들은 그런 걸 좋아하잖아?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_904EF956_CCD6_4D57_9DC7_26AE83D5139E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e97daf9a4f4d1ce6cc9d7dcebf591eba0653d9e605064ff7c323a30197e46eab
#. default-sha256: f1bb86a62b7fb4fcddc987d19dfbe960b2d3221b438402541300fbf2820f761d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_904EF956_CCD6_4D57_9DC7_26AE83D5139E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We called it Casa Nostra—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Our Home”—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and we pretended it was actually "
"ours."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫카사 노스트라＜우리의 집＞란 이름도 붙이고⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫실컷 놀았지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CB1E5358_ADB8_434E_A3FD_EE3F25BDCFCD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 438b4c9913312939bbfa1ee6bf2aadeed1c3a7476acc7b7d413cc03bbae00f86
#. default-sha256: 84afa3ad118cfe59901135993fba658ad7ef231eac99a5a8062bbe740a1f3a01
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CB1E5358_ADB8_434E_A3FD_EE3F25BDCFCD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We drew circles on the wall in chalk and used it for target practice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫분필로 벽에 동그라미를 그려서 ⟪k:1⟫다트를 했고――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B1ADEF6E_9287_458E_8A2E_7FBEC57F82CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53369b781185b7ca01e5fe60db9dcf9124e94466574321ce51bd27c7852cb0f8
#. default-sha256: c06d89d61d1e6399792026fcb5100acc0360f3ea539e49c50775645d80d7c455
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B1ADEF6E_9287_458E_8A2E_7FBEC57F82CE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We brought up a bail of straw and used it to make makeshift beds."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지푸라기랑 모포를 가져와서 ⟪k:1⟫간소한 침대도 만드는 등."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6D3F6063_8589_49F9_9C55_175CFCB95DD5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed559b587848ec833926b38605dfefaa64e286584ccb783c71b4541a13cac800
#. default-sha256: 0cbd44162f494d4e319b5f757e2a0fb8d49a8445964e5ef689f533ba47d9c8a4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6D3F6063_8589_49F9_9C55_175CFCB95DD5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When either of us got into fights with our parents, we’d stay the night here instead of home."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나나 ⟪k:1⟫네가, ⟪k:2⟫부모님이랑 싸운 날엔 ⟪k:3⟫여길 이용하기도 했지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CCB1C88A_AC58_4BE9_A9D6_52917DB50F78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf63553213f1f69f7112359b2d5ff369f75a6cd2e4490c0af8ae1ce8c6a08f55
#. default-sha256: fb1d8076676ecbb410d11561ca5a7aea11765831b91b888358bcd1fbfbb2448c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CCB1C88A_AC58_4BE9_A9D6_52917DB50F78"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In retrospect, I’m sure they knew where we were going, and just let us do our thing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫지금 돌이켜 보면 ⟪k:1⟫부모님도 우리 행선지는 다 파악했겠지만 ⟪k:2⟫마음대로 하게 둔 거겠다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_98FB91E2_F439_41A4_B8A7_8B97EB96BFE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a5269e880509a87f3144e24dbc3cb9d715baf1fa98a0735ca2c21c32f47469c
#. default-sha256: 6d8af8e5f378d9185f81d838957456eae87ed29acc783c68ca2fe019d29392ed
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_98FB91E2_F439_41A4_B8A7_8B97EB96BFE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh yeah, there was this one time we were playing and a huge storm rolled in, trapping us up "
"there."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아 그래, ⟪k:1⟫한창 놀 때 센 태풍이 불어서 ⟪k:2⟫못 돌아간 적도 있었나~."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A08454AA_660C_4D48_896F_E734565DB339
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 526c56223bcef1d32cf91c0af73c7a2003d1eb45834ab16024c335cbd066bacc
#. default-sha256: 01c3d628afbb2b2e4f4e654f8ffbc69dea7195688ebb20f48b6701b8d4629eb0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A08454AA_660C_4D48_896F_E734565DB339"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The wind wasn’t just howling—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was screaming bloody murder."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫바람 소리가 비명을 넘어 ⟪k:1⟫절규처럼 들리던 날."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E07DA6DF_8CAA_4E0E_8AC4_ED032E67AC78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96da96c7359d1c58df8c705f4d8e99f376b651c1506f2755183cfdbde69df580
#. default-sha256: 2ead06f5844249a5d8c7fe1326537fdc3200fdd08bb13028aec3c6e62b10308a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E07DA6DF_8CAA_4E0E_8AC4_ED032E67AC78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was blowing so hard I thought the house might fly away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I recall, you were "
"crying that night."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫집까지 날아가지 않을까 싶을 만큼 ⟪k:1⟫거셌지. ⟪k:2⟫……내 기억상으론 ⟪k:3⟫너 그때 역시 ⟪k:4⟫운 "
"것 같은데."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CE4A3EE0_25B3_4F1F_8B23_A9526C4A583C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72a86b1e12cb768d37255ade981598cdd23ded8444ff2102e681755d7b5556c2
#. default-sha256: b79a8aa64373581e2f4d3a0fb495f9c07f0e482b8e4bb7927dde9e63917d0ec1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CE4A3EE0_25B3_4F1F_8B23_A9526C4A583C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hey, Nero! You here to see me off too?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫앗, ⟪k:2⟫네로! ⟪k:3⟫너도 날 배웅해 주게?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_86BCCEFB_2D58_44BF_B3F9_DFF7B355BFA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4a8a49edfa85945a39df3653c3b5865f328aa37daf20c76038e8313f147d89f
#. default-sha256: 552073931f118a40db70635585c146e6bfdfef754d02793e1df79b293e0a5a3b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_86BCCEFB_2D58_44BF_B3F9_DFF7B355BFA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aaaah, there you go wagging your tail with that dumb look on your face. ⟪k:2⟫You have "
"no idea what’s going on, do you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아아~, ⟪k:2⟫꼬리까지 살랑거리긴.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그 칠칠맞은 얼굴을 보니 ⟪k:5⟫아무것도 모르는구"
"나~?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7E6688E5_CE53_43F7_9254_18DD8DC8ED88
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c67d0ee2a1f3477f23ac7284a185b723b14d69ecb275aac94cc51181da1437ac
#. default-sha256: 5ae254d9a91e90fa4b66cd55c8342fd10f77710f021c1d113221f9f3568d563a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7E6688E5_CE53_43F7_9254_18DD8DC8ED88"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It wasn’t just the two of us who had made Casa Nostra our home base, though. ⟪k:1⟫There was "
"one more—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫a stray, black dog."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫카사 노스트라엔 우리 말고도 ⟪k:1⟫앵기는 녀석이 한 마리 더 있었지? ⟪k:2⟫새까만 들개."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C60A5C6E_4397_4583_8C53_FDF14A32F11D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5bc7ab9e823b509cd36e63fd2edb3463c70a6ab9185ad355fe19b454e2b0c72
#. default-sha256: eedeee2bc826d98111397024b61c4ef14efbfe513925e5275d80c7fffdeeddb5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C60A5C6E_4397_4583_8C53_FDF14A32F11D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m pretty sure it didn’t have actually black fur, though, and it was just really, really "
"dirty."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런데 ⟪k:1⟫그건 털이 까만 게 아니라 ⟪k:2⟫그냥 더러워서 그런 거였겠지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_059B0B2F_D311_4652_A270_0198AD051606
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aae57214399e2f3232c77cb8e193c71b710ef37e8a95c3f3b3fc1a325ae18f1b
#. default-sha256: 6b17c0da189ad02253112d5e09c99bb284e54c6a888ff3fbc8b602c10a1dd99c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_059B0B2F_D311_4652_A270_0198AD051606"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of course he doesn’t.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He’s a stupid animal."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그야 ⟪k:1⟫모르겠지. ⟪k:2⟫얘는 꼴통견이잖아."

#: scenario3:scenario3_36970D02_8361_4FF3_BD00_DA24A2B438B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4bc5f6cbd74d4908308d69ae88d9042c9c9068a41bcac7fe347172eb43e6e92c
#. default-sha256: 106558d62783db184af550cc0467c36642fd2deafc0dcc28717c7ada6b57a3d0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_36970D02_8361_4FF3_BD00_DA24A2B438B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, don’t talk about him like that.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He’s one of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런 소리 마. ⟪k:1⟫우리랑 한패잖아."

#: scenario3:scenario3_002A5ECC_42A9_46D6_9509_AC557355B3E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7278549389d9372266e84ce74363c02111dcff3e78f814bf1dfb5505027ddd0c
#. default-sha256: dcfacaa6df52e1442dd54f2027e0e4c64e56ed6cd2f82ff6aa71f7a4059cf9b2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_002A5ECC_42A9_46D6_9509_AC557355B3E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...What were you planning to do about Nero? Just leave him behind?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……네로는 ⟪k:1⟫어떡하려고. ⟪k:2⟫두고 가게?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9CAF0FCC_B280_47D4_8B2E_5111F418D5CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 623b0115cedaf77c98b57df34304341f16bdc731100921d3efc42f2a8c0cffa4
#. default-sha256: 3b199afc0561664ea96d90cee69b18199485fa6c55eacc02ca7cbf0605980dd6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9CAF0FCC_B280_47D4_8B2E_5111F418D5CA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mm... ⟪k:1⟫Nothing else I can do.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Can’t bring a dog in the carriage..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫응……, ⟪k:1⟫두고 갈 수밖에 없지.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫마차엔 개를 못 태우는 데다――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_38472D22_E780_41D9_B399_0C20CD8CA8DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8cc71c6bcbba95a24eb8bc318c9d90e771b2784fd3ed45c883f857b64a2352e
#. default-sha256: 54205a9eb4448053daa3ad8cbb2b88c322060295cb5924c62d8940fba724ba20
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38472D22_E780_41D9_B399_0C20CD8CA8DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Besides, you’re here, so it’ll be fine!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You take care of Nero, all right?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네가 있으니까 ⟪k:1⟫괜찮을 거 아니야!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫네로 잘 돌봐 줘야 한다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0F4F8B09_6C5A_490B_9EF3_FFFD04D7C347
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9197340ad830d5c2f1ef3bc9fdca70b5de8cbccad679eec24ae4c812aa7700b8
#. default-sha256: 845a27bcfdcd996c9c4607c75e33de94345d0ef29dec4f4c9d5db5bf0b9bb0de
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0F4F8B09_6C5A_490B_9EF3_FFFD04D7C347"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He doesn’t like me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’re the only one who ⟪k:3⟫can⟪k:4⟫ take care of him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫난 이 녀석한테 미움 샀어.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫너 말곤 돌볼 녀석도 없어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C5DF990B_B101_4DA6_89BE_EC5024BB7C54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d4a3835987d3d76f2a8fb0986f6fc7adb864e2b424636feb7f661945d369cab
#. default-sha256: 0851dc7c89ffe0cdd38bee8562afda6462136fac3aa65ca1ecd4cf3e9b43419c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C5DF990B_B101_4DA6_89BE_EC5024BB7C54"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maybe so, but I’m not coming back.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He’ll starve to death if you don’t figure "
"something out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래도 ⟪k:1⟫난 다신 못 돌아오는데.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫네가 안 돌보면 ⟪k:4⟫네로가 굶어 죽을걸."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B51B6665_8779_4240_8732_DE8B2765CC51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff0d90250eab60e423acedec7899c10593c00701dd7f68cc2912374a8a971b58
#. default-sha256: 098ef0aaeec5377167a57e5e77d5891464928a623ce98d8c9738d1335ace5b28
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B51B6665_8779_4240_8732_DE8B2765CC51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He’s a puny runt. I doubt he could win in a fight for scraps.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C’mon, do it for me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫얘는 ⟪k:1⟫덩치도 좀 작은 게 ⟪k:2⟫싸움도 못 하게 생겼잖아.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫응? ⟪k:5⟫부탁할게."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3AEBDA65_13AE_4322_BEAF_0231A4AFA8D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8baa9b78a13f3b62fda6dbb0604c400cadda8516dc989a09fc4aaaae7fcf6efe
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3AEBDA65_13AE_4322_BEAF_0231A4AFA8D3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D078F5E1_7625_403F_98B3_39F5C781EF3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc019e1decc6e49c1a15ba0eb375270aad27b349d26d1e6c26972bcd32f1228d
#. default-sha256: 9af1224d82dad94b6483a2b49aca0e0060c2db74ee0bf3dbb823ac9c1196a341
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D078F5E1_7625_403F_98B3_39F5C781EF3A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You said you won’t be coming back.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Did you mean that?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아까 ⟪k:1⟫마지막이라 그랬지. ⟪k:2⟫진짜로…… 마지막으로 삼게?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_66F2A51C_D85C_4335_9FDE_436C354A7ACE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a7f785c53b2c7d838cae7f57868ae3977413ee3f90c5d8f6d18bd25069d4026
#. default-sha256: db759e910781cde2a3f78c445a1e4cf0404796ace5001fb967ebd8fa5a06c3a8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_66F2A51C_D85C_4335_9FDE_436C354A7ACE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you absolutely never returning to this town?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 도시에는 ⟪k:1⟫영영 안 돌아올 거야?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C6AB9DBD_DA31_4922_B89D_C3B382A55377
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b43c335a51fa1be05dddeee9f115d1443735862f6bc81b1131e62ab7cb1df82a
#. default-sha256: 2669f284b9c466d35396cd101828c9ce64dd891ef09227882b8201581e249311
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C6AB9DBD_DA31_4922_B89D_C3B382A55377"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There’s no telling what may or may not happen,⟪k:1⟫so it’s best not to get your hopes up."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Better that than the pain of getting let down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……앞날은 ⟪k:1⟫모르지. ⟪k:2⟫그래서 ⟪k:3⟫큰 기대는 안 하려고. ⟪k:4⟫괜히 기대하다―― 배신당하는 "
"게 ⟪k:5⟫더 힘들잖아."

#: scenario3:scenario3_81909208_21EC_449A_A0C3_9F99880108A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da1b9d7882c0f3e18b4afbf4afdb6cbd766a2b4c5745186a3a6c2277f37ef820
#. default-sha256: bb5d9e5a190f86af142b116d6af857ba631a3ef9baa0bff9c2c5f4be58030a40
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_81909208_21EC_449A_A0C3_9F99880108A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Well, well, I’ve turned into quite the cynic, huh."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아아~, ⟪k:1⟫나도 참 애늙은이 같지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A893CCD9_E92A_46B7_8928_A019DE169A8D
